# CAN Interface

## Purpose

Provides communication between the Air Data Box and external systems.

## Responsibilities

- CAN initialization
- Frame transmission
- Frame reception
- Error monitoring

## Planned CAN Messages

### Frame 1

- Airspeed
- Altitude

### Frame 2

- Dynamic Pressure
- Static Pressure

### Frame 3

- Temperature Data

### Frame 4

- Health Status

